\paragraph{The epoch confound in D\&R evaluation.}
The epoch confound identified in \S\ref{sec:main-results} accounts for ${>}$95\% of D\&R's reported advantage; the residual ($\Delta{=}0.017$, 3 seeds) falls within cross-seed variance and is robust to LR schedule choice ($\Delta{=}0.006$ under independent schedules).
